    {
      "id": "text_left_poem",
      "kind": "text",
      "file": "D:\\codes\\collage-recreate-v9-output\\model-comparison-20261023\\runtime\\tasks\\task-20261023-161\\assets\\text\\text_left_poem.png",
      "sha256": "743d20ecc525d523f9d60e09d92974f983bcc996654a2e2829b3c2c5bfb91fe3",
      "quality": "approximate",
      "source": null,
      "metadata": {
        "font": "C:\\Windows\\Fonts\\msyh.ttc",
        "font_size_px": 46,
        "requested_font_size_px": null,
        "line_count": 7,
        "line_spacing": 1.2742,
        "line_spacing_mode": "fit_bbox",
        "line_advance_px": 79.0,
        "align": "left",
        "fit_scale": null,
        "text": "我从此感到幸福\n轻易 松脆的幸福\n如同围炉火烤\n你伸手揉碎了茶饼\n芬苦淡淡的 却萦绕不去\n我的幸福\n只需要我伸出手享",
        "text_rendered": true,
        "font_match": "approximate",
        "quality": "approximate"
      },
      "group": null
    },
    {
      "id": "text_right_poem",
      "kind": "text",
      "file": "D:\\codes\\collage-recreate-v9-output\\model-comparison-20261023\\runtime\\tasks\\task-20261023-161\\assets\\text\\text_right_poem.png",
      "sha256": "1f5c782ba38abe35d4a69c2408ccd3a865b0ec88a9dfa4094d8f6292f8e38fdb",
      "quality": "approximate",
      "source": null,
      "metadata": {
        "font": "C:\\Windows\\Fonts\\msyh.ttc",
        "font_size_px": 46,
        "requested_font_size_px": null,
        "line_count": 8,
        "line_spacing": 1.2028,
        "line_spacing_mode": "fit_bbox",
        "line_advance_px": 74.571,
        "align": "right",
        "fit_scale": null,
        "text": "在这个世界上\n幸福从来就没有标准答案\n有的人吃路边摊\n但也要拍照记录\n有人看到了日落\n也要感叹生活的美好\n只要是你自己喜欢的日子\n就是最好的日子",
        "text_rendered": true,
        "font_match": "approximate",
        "quality": "approximate"
      },
      "group": null
    },
